# cl-300 with expected answers (ground truth for Brain v1 "what next?" evals)
# Today is Monday 23 Nov 2026. Each scenario is followed by an expect: block (3 roles x 3 moods, max 3 picks each).
# Date assumptions: in 3 days = Thu 26 Nov; next monday = Mon 30 Nov; 15 tarikh = 15 Dec; 5 tarikh = 5 Dec; 20 tarikh = 20 Dec; agle hafte = Fri 4 Dec.
# Tasks marked "after X" are blocked until X is done; blocked tasks are never picked. Done tasks are never picked.
# Scenario 092 contains deliberate near-duplicates; an answer never lists both members of a duplicate pair.

